  "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Agentic Coding Research Report - 2026-04-18</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #000000;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n\n        a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .header {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            padding: 8px 12px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        .header h1 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .header .date {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-top: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 12px;\n        }\n\n        .three-column-layout {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 40% 35% 25%;\n            gap: 12px;\n            margin-top: 12px;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 1200px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .technical-insights {\n                grid-column: 1 / -1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .technical-insights {\n                grid-column: auto;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .section {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            padding: 12px;\n        }\n\n        .section-header {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            padding-bottom: 8px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #ff6600;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .item {\n            margin-bottom: 16px;\n            padding-bottom: 12px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;\n        }\n\n        .item:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            padding-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .item-title {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:visited {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-description {\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta .separator {\n            margin: 0 6px;\n        }\n\n        .tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin-right: 4px;\n            margin-top: 4px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        .category-badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin-right: 4px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        .category-badge.code-agent {\n            background-color: #ffe4c4;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .source-badge {\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            font-style: italic;\n        }\n\n        .update-type {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin-right: 4px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.feature {\n            background-color: #d4edda;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.release {\n            background-color: #cce5ff;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin-right: 4px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.technical {\n            background-color: #e7f3ff;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.opinion {\n            background-color: #fff3cd;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.news {\n            background-color: #f8d7da;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.paper {\n            background-color: #e2e3e5;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.tutorial {\n            background-color: #d4edda;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.discussion {\n            background-color: #ffe4c4;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.tool {\n            background-color: #e7e7e7;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .footer {\n            margin-top: 24px;\n            padding: 12px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        .footer a {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .empty-state {\n            color: #828282;\n            font-style: italic;\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 20px;\n        }\n\n        .community-quote {\n            background-color: #f8f8f8;\n            padding: 6px 8px;\n            margin-top: 6px;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            border-left: 2px solid #ff6600;\n            font-style: italic;\n        }\n\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n\n            .section {\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n\n            .item {\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header class=\"header\">\n        <h1>Agentic Coding Research Report</h1>\n        <div class=\"date\">2026-04-18</div>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <main class=\"three-column-layout\">\n            <!-- New Products Section -->\n            <section class=\"new-products section\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-header\">New Products</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/intent-4\" target=\"_blank\">Intent</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        AI agents that build, verify, and ship features when you describe them - autonomous development workflows that automate the full software development lifecycle from feature description to deployment.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category-badge code-agent\">code agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>Released: 2026-04-15</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\n                        Ranked #29 on Product Hunt monthly leaderboard (April 2026) with 378 upvotes\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/ovren\" target=\"_blank\">Ovren</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Your AI engineering department that clears your backlog - autonomous AI engineers work directly in your real codebase to deliver production-ready, reviewable code updates while maintaining full user control.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category-badge code-agent\">code agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>Released: 2026-04-15</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\n                        Received 286 upvotes on Product Hunt launch day (April 15, 2026)\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates section\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-header\">Product Updates</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        GitHub Copilot\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <strong>Copilot CLI Auto Model Selection</strong> - GitHub Copilot CLI now supports Copilot auto model selection, automatically choosing the most appropriate model for the task based on performance, speed, and availability.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-17</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">changelog</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        GitHub Copilot\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <strong>Claude Opus 4.7 Generally Available</strong> - Anthropic's latest Opus model, Claude Opus 4.7, is now rolling out on GitHub Copilot. The model delivers stronger multi-step task performance and more reliable agentic execution based on early testing.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-16</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-04-16-claude-opus-4-7-is-generally-available/\" target=\"_blank\">notes</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        GitHub Copilot\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <strong>Manage Agent Skills with GitHub CLI</strong> - New 'gh skill' command in GitHub CLI makes it easy to discover, install, and manage agent skills, which are reshaping how developers work with AI coding agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-16</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-04-16-manage-agent-skills-with-github-cli/\" target=\"_blank\">notes</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        Cursor\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <strong>Background Agents in Slack Integration</strong> - You can now launch Background Agents directly from Slack by mentioning @Cursor. Agents can read the thread, understand context, and create PRs in GitHub without leaving the conversation.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-15</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.sh/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">changelog</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        GitHub Copilot\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <strong>Copilot Cloud Agent Policy via Custom Properties</strong> - Organizations can now selectively enable GitHub Copilot cloud agent (CCA) access on a per-organization basis using custom properties, replacing the previous all-or-nothing approach.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-15</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-04-15-enable-copilot-cloud-agent-via-custom-properties/\" target=\"_blank\">notes</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        Devin\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <strong>Close PR or Convert to Draft in Review UI</strong> - The PR review merge bar now includes options to close a PR or convert it to a draft directly from the review page. Additional improvements include inline session rename, smart table column sizing, and faster sidebar loading.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-15</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/2026\" target=\"_blank\">notes</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        GitHub Copilot\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <strong>Model Selection for Claude and Codex Agents on GitHub.com</strong> - Model selection is now available for Claude and Codex third-party coding agents on github.com. Users can select a model when initiating agent work.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-14</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-04-14-model-selection-for-claude-and-codex-agents-on-github-com/\" target=\"_blank\">notes</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        Claude Code\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <strong>Claude Code Version 2.1.69-2.1.101 Release Wave</strong> - Key updates include Remote Control for browser/mobile access, Multi-Repository Context Window for working across multiple repos, Enhanced Collaborative Tools, MCP enhancements, and improved VS Code integration.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">release</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-11</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.getaiperks.com/en/articles/claude-code-updates\" target=\"_blank\">notes</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        Cursor\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <strong>Cursor 1.0 Release</strong> - Introduces BugBot for automatic code review and bug detection, Background Agent now available to all users, Agent support for Jupyter Notebooks, Memories beta feature, and MCP one-click install with OAuth support.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">release</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-10</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.sh/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">notes</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        Devin\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        <strong>Auto-merge from Devin Review</strong> - You can now enable or disable GitHub auto-merge directly from the Devin Review merge button, so approved pull requests land as soon as checks pass without an extra trip to GitHub.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-08</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/2026\" target=\"_blank\">notes</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section -->\n            <section class=\"technical-insights section\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-header\">Technical Insights</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://anvil.works/forum/t/anvil-reference-docs-for-ai-agents/25885\" target=\"_blank\">Anvil Reference Docs for AI Agents</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Anvil community released reference repository for AI coding agents. GitHub repository anvil-llm-reference provides Anvil-specific context to help agents avoid rediscovery and improve coding accuracy.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-18</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.truefoundry.com/blog/llm-agents\" target=\"_blank\">LLM Agents: The Complete Guide for 2026</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        TrueFoundry published comprehensive guide to LLM agents covering architecture, implementation patterns, and best practices for building agentic AI systems in 2026.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type tutorial\">tutorial</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-18</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://blog.cloudflare.com/project-think/\" target=\"_blank\">Project Think: Building the Next Generation of AI Agents on Cloudflare</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Cloudflare introduced Project Think focused on running LLM-generated code safely with Dynamic Workers. Features Agent Readiness score to evaluate site preparedness for AI agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-17</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.databricks.com/blog/governing-coding-agent-sprawl-unity-ai-gateway\" target=\"_blank\">Governing Coding Agent Sprawl with Unity AI Gateway</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Databricks released solutions for managing coding agent sprawl through Unity AI Gateway. Addresses governance challenges as enterprises deploy multiple AI coding agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-17</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://developers.googleblog.com/a2ui-v0-9-generative-ui/\" target=\"_blank\">A2UI v0.9: The New Standard for Portable, Framework-Agnostic UI</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Google's A2UI Team introduced Agent SDK and shared web-core library enabling AI agents to drive cross-platform renderers. Advances portable UI for agentic applications.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-17</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.14718\" target=\"_blank\">ArXiv: The Agentification of Scientific Research</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Paper exploring how AI agents are transforming scientific research from a physicist's perspective. Discusses implications for automated discovery and human-AI collaboration in research.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type paper\">paper</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-17</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/17/factory-1-5b-valuation-ai-coding/\" target=\"_blank\">Factory hits $1.5B valuation to build AI coding for enterprises</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        AI coding startup Factory reaches $1.5B valuation focusing on enterprise AI coding solutions, reflecting continued investor confidence in AI developer tools.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type news\">news</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-17</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">llm-anthropic 0.25 released with Claude Opus 4.7 support</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        New model claude-opus-4.7 supports thinking_effort: xhigh. Added thinking_display and thinking_adaptive boolean options. Increased default max_tokens to maximum allowed for each model.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-16</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Qwen3.6-35B-A3B on my laptop drew me a better pelican than Claude Opus 4.7</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Comparison of two big model releases: Qwen3.6-35B-A3B from Alibaba and Claude Opus 4.7 from Anthropic, using the pelican riding a bicycle benchmark.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">opinion</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-16</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/16/openai-codex-anthropic/\" target=\"_blank\">OpenAI takes aim at Anthropic with beefed-up Codex</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        OpenAI releases enhanced Codex model with increased desktop control capabilities, directly competing with Anthropic's Claude models in the agentic coding space.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type news\">news</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-16</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/16/insightfinder-series-a/\" target=\"_blank\">InsightFinder raises $15M to help companies figure out where AI agents go wrong</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Startup raises $15M for AI agent monitoring and debugging platform, addressing growing need for tools to understand and fix agent failures in production.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type news\">news</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-16</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Bryan Cantrill: LLMs lack the virtue of laziness</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        LLMs don't feel need to optimize for future time and will dump more onto layercake of garbage. Human laziness forces us to develop crisp abstractions because we don't want to waste time on clunky ones.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">opinion</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-13</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">SQLite 3.53.0 released with ALTER TABLE enhancements</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Major release includes ALTER TABLE can now add/remove NOT NULL and CHECK constraints, new json_array_insert() function, and significant CLI improvements with new Query Results Formatter library.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-11</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/14/gitar-funding-agent-security/\" target=\"_blank\">Gitar raises $9M to use agents to secure code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Startup emerges from stealth with $9M funding for AI agent-based code security platform, applying agentic AI to vulnerability detection and remediation.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type news\">news</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-14</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/15/openai-agents-sdk-update/\" target=\"_blank\">OpenAI updates its Agents SDK to help enterprises build safer agents</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        OpenAI releases updated Agents SDK with enhanced safety features and capabilities for enterprise agent development, reflecting maturation of agentic AI tooling.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type news\">news</span>\n                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-15</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer class=\"footer\">\n            <p>\n                Report generated by <a href=\"https://claude.ai\" target=\"_blank\">Agent Code Daily</a> - Powered by <a href=\"https://claude.ai\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Agent SDK</a>\n            </p>\n            <p style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">\n                <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Hacker News</a> |\n                <a href=\"https://github.com\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a> |\n                <a href=\"https://producthunt.com\" target=\"_blank\">Product Hunt</a>\n            </p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
}

