pan>\n   301→                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n   302→                        <span>Released: 2026-04-15</span>\n   303→                    </div>\n   304→                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\n   305→                        Ranked #29 on Product Hunt monthly leaderboard (April 2026) with 378 upvotes\n   306→                    </div>\n   307→                </div>\n   308→\n   309→                <div class=\"item\">\n   310→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   311→                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/ovren\" target=\"_blank\">Ovren</a>\n   312→                    </div>\n   313→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   314→                        Your AI engineering department that clears your backlog - autonomous AI engineers work directly in your real codebase to deliver production-ready, reviewable code updates while maintaining full user control.\n   315→                    </div>\n   316→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   317→                        <span class=\"category-badge code-agent\">code agent</span>\n   318→                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n   319→                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n   320→                        <span>Released: 2026-04-15</span>\n   321→                    </div>\n   322→                    <div class=\"community-quote\">\n   323→                        Received 286 upvotes on Product Hunt launch day (April 15, 2026)\n   324→                    </div>\n   325→                </div>\n   326→            </section>\n   327→\n   328→            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n   329→            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\">\n   330→                <h2 class=\"section-header\">Product Updates</h2>\n   331→\n   332→                <div class=\"item\">\n   333→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   334→                        GitHub Copilot\n   335→                    </div>\n   336→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   337→                        <strong>Copilot CLI Auto Model Selection</strong> - GitHub Copilot CLI now supports Copilot auto model selection, automatically choosing the most appropriate model for the task based on performance, speed, and availability.\n   338→                    </div>\n   339→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   340→                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n   341→                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n   342→                        <span>2026-04-17</span>\n   343→                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n   344→                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">changelog</a>\n   345→                    </div>\n   346→                </div>\n   347→\n   348→                <div class=\"item\">\n   349→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   350→                        GitHub Copilot\n   351→                    </div>\n   352→                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n   353→                        <strong>Claude Opus 4.7 Generally Available</strong> - Anthropic's latest Opus model, Claude Opus 4.7, is now rolling out on GitHub Copilot. The model delivers stronger multi-step task performance and more reliable agentic execution based on early testing.\n   354→                    </div>\n   355→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   356→                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">feature</span>\n   357→                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n   358→                        <span>2026-04-16</span>\n   359→                        <span class=\"separator\">|</span>\n   360→                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-04-16-claude-opus-4-7-is-generally-available/\" target=\"_blank\">notes</a>\n   361→                    </div>\n   362→          